    {
      "number": 5116,
      "text": "O you who believe, when you consult the Messenger in private, give something in charity before your consultation; that is better for you and more conducive to purity. But if you do not have the means, then Allah is All-Forgiving, Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 58,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُجَادلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mujaadila",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pleading Woman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 544,
      "ruku": 477,
      "hizbQuarter": 217,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5117,
      "text": "Are you afraid of giving charities before your consultations with him? If you are unable to do so, and Allah has pardoned you, then establish prayer and give zakah, and obey Allah and His Messenger. And Allah is All-Aware of what you do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 58,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُجَادلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mujaadila",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pleading Woman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 544,
      "ruku": 477,
      "hizbQuarter": 217,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5118,
      "text": "Do you not see those [hypocrites] who take as allies people who have incurred Allah’s wrath? They are neither of you nor of them, and they swear falsely while they know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 58,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُجَادلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mujaadila",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pleading Woman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 544,
      "ruku": 478,
      "hizbQuarter": 218,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5119,
      "text": "Allah has prepared for them a severe punishment. Evil is indeed what they do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 58,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُجَادلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mujaadila",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pleading Woman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 544,
      "ruku": 478,
      "hizbQuarter": 218,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5120,
      "text": "They have taken their oaths as a shield, in order to hinder people from the way of Allah. For them there will be a humiliating punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 58,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُجَادلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mujaadila",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pleading Woman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 544,
      "ruku": 478,
      "hizbQuarter": 218,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5121,
      "text": "Neither their wealth nor their children will avail them anything against Allah. They are the people of the Fire; they will abide therein forever.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 58,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُجَادلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mujaadila",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pleading Woman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 544,
      "ruku": 478,
      "hizbQuarter": 218,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5122,
      "text": "On the Day when Allah will raise them all, they will swear to Him as they swear to you, thinking that they have something to stand on[8]. Indeed, it is they who are the liars.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 58,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُجَادلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mujaadila",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pleading Woman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 544,
      "ruku": 478,
      "hizbQuarter": 218,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5123,
      "text": "Satan has taken hold of them and has thus caused them to forget the remembrance of Allah. They are the party of Satan. Indeed, the party of Satan will be the losers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 58,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُجَادلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mujaadila",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pleading Woman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 544,
      "ruku": 478,
      "hizbQuarter": 218,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5124,
      "text": "Indeed, those who oppose Allah and His Messenger, they are among the most debased.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 58,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُجَادلَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mujaadila",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Pleading Woman",
        "numberOfAyahs": 22,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 544,
      "ruku": 478,
      "hizbQuarter": 218,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5125,
      "text": "Allah has decreed, “I and My messengers will surely prevail.” Indeed, Allah is All-Powerful, All-Mighty.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 58,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُجَادلَةِ",
